traffic: busy 2ms/10ms, OFDM 2.5ms/6ms, stress 2ms/4ms, small-MTU 1Mbps fallback 4.5ms/20ms.
RF calibration at WiFi start: ASSUMED 5 ms at 50 % TX (partial calibration, NVS data). Not measured; see A7.
